{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52967","headline":"游枋口（幷序） 薜荔壁 · 郑辕","name":"游枋口（幷序） 薜荔壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薜荔生空山，幽姿媚苔壁。\n根封石燕泥，花似乳窦滴。\n灵均没已久，荣落谁人惜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑辕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}